{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1373,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ee6e143142abd2a26b2305d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为今天的午餐太好吃，\r\n不小心吃太多了。\r\n……算了，多跑跑就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40c4b89a298e0f8a187caf2c6315f1e1932863cb366a0397c9d8233053d8db82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0314aa84678d817ba3c0557a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许是因为安静的缘故吧，\r\n我能够清楚听见彼此的声音呢。\r\n要不要再稍微聊聊天呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "51b21ac1c291a42b5e5f1e9e2a4e4abbefa0dba4d7c1e37ee413136a9c415329",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3cc59d5ab06e554759e1817",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天的事就留待明天再想吧。毕竟\r\n会发生什么事，到头来还是得等到\r\n当下才会知道，不是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "883ccde925c64dd2ef1e50a81eaf14859dcb21fb390e746c98b1b66abc1dedd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f0917025f44ba5f2e745dcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不论去到哪个地方，都充满着\r\n缤纷的色彩呢。可以的话，\r\n我真不想错过任何景色啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60b4561f82936c28a7fbc11c257e2190b9578eb709cc8d471d4b1f78b9cc1a5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c1513d525900f5a1ac96e7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有多耀眼，就有多哀伤。\r\n季节的更迭对我来说，\r\n就是充满了这样的感觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ea5609f1be9fc72fdb7a3b4849f4a37edfc44eb317d55304efe70a74599bcfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d407d75556fcbf1834d6482",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有很多事都会渐渐随风而逝……\r\n让我觉得时间过得比平常还快呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45a4001716f81beac7016ada93ce203c9fcb63399a2e84a380ebc1b019176c4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4086373cde5577746da56aa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "空气干燥，指尖冰冷……\r\n为了至少让身体暖和起来，\r\n稍微去跑一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce0f4d303d90fea996cba1bb1f11488b45d812b83ab9f8561a551eaf4fa4b65a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6ad84e79c41c14779715003",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf4a2c74f8d8a52bdd0731ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "王牌真的是个很温柔的人呢。\r\n她还提醒我今天是交作业的期限……\r\n啊，我还没有交耶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3111add54148765d6fa4aba27fa22e5f652cc9f0a7d311c04221f9b7f2a80a8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b25b4200d799126f2e8d239",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只是想一起乐在其中而已……\r\n但我的想法却迟迟无法\r\n传达给鲁道夫知道呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f11835d8983f967df3cff4fa4cd267117b2178ea71cdfcbe6b382da754beb88c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19fbb4065628a237520e373b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "独居生活很不错喔。如果我住宿舍，\r\n大概每天都会因为违规被骂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b47c238450b46fd20342871d8de709f08cd7db8a4fd372d2fdd8ac0d204dde07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df0c2a93fd1d450a45646118",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有时候会与红宝、变革聊天。\r\n明明我们的个性大相径庭，\r\n但聚在一起就很开心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ba67a20bbc7c49e4250e79f7fe5c6cd9706dc4283ba671663c4ce9e1e4e1a35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86b21017e42d252086097622",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有间很喜欢的咖啡厅，\r\n但每次去都客满，\r\n最后只能放弃回家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d76a7bb261c2ba1c37bf086e8af44f27a7dec8f0fc8c1caa4bef0bf070d801db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cc2b022db1383ef49aee2fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服的设计很棒吧？\r\n腰部周围不受拘束，非常舒适。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d8d0b814eb57f7c0e61fe186456ef1a8d4df9369b465918eba34fea17f2b9b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f42f5a3e3eef548d27b69ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然要跳舞，\r\n果然还是在正中央跳\r\n最开心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb60a4b5b925240b596068fe98c9414223faff57128a74ac85e39c06685f4b15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19ff266cc1477d4842d4e876",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这套衣服，我感觉自己\r\n就像身处在世界的中心，\r\n可以随时奔驰到任何地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16594ec95ce26e9768c4f57d4eb149040396c3fb6bfc87b776f38603d0f386ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:549489183513dcc050e268d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的父母经常来观看竞赛。\r\n当他们从观众席上与我对到眼时，\r\n就会流露出温柔又开心的样子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a06674d1ea068ca4fa020fd85b72d7ae53e6f8e948406b1884d0c6154149e3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3389050ced789c13098eccab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨泡澡很舒服呢。\r\n那会让我有一种只有我在\r\n尽情享受那段时间的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ae6ac0391dde0854737f69b8cab945eb049aca074ba26d5e13686693b09fb6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fcc8f8d298cbb12508eb8e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝着树梢摇曳的方向走去，\r\n找寻最为合适的地方。这么一来，\r\n午餐也会变得像是在野餐一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c99e4735f35b9d1dfa78d42fcdcb5bb8937efd92c3fecc03f0e222428847a5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3869ba696e527e9d03b9ffec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每天晚上都会保养脚趾甲哦。\r\n因为我不希望自己变得没办法跑步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e6f3d7817ac7ee0d4e9167573b6fe80b7b9f91b4c9866e6158d4d479b656e38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49de0fe6abd6eecff72b443b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有预感接下来会发生许多事情……\r\n尽管这个时期令人眼花撩乱，\r\n但同时也让内心雀跃无比呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23d23690c37485e63d6ee12099876b839e53f383497932f0e58ca49bb35376e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae48785021d4717f5da160cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是个会让人想追寻轨迹的季节呢。\r\n……你懂这种感觉吗？\r\n不懂也完全没关系哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2056e990eab7b7c02d8de3a0df3471b4a5cca585945ec2dd407b2d5888125e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d52a1cd62d13f6eda3c108aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "落叶被风吹了过来，\r\n我不小心像蓑衣虫那样缩了起来。\r\n丸善却说那样「很可爱」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9c2c6ea77840bc101f34b69f5d47b414329277a2c45164bfbc62f11a1383155",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8485e2d5fc1dd2549643ddbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一个季节即将到来了呢。\r\n至于要前往哪里，\r\n就等我迈出脚步后再决定吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "171931458071d1e97fbfd896e2d383b9edd4bc180bfd1746d82881d036e3ea2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcb740f27fba308138701db2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，开始吧。\r\n做到我满意为止！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9245f91b9157b8a841034af2fbad56f7413aacec7b564f6381925ba1e769d29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b1d0eb79ecebcb3722f4911",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行こうか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "818fd86e117bf5c997896dd7e70da749c9d81263c79a506c4c52b202dfff60f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d3e0c2f9013b5860a8b0fa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以告诉我训练项目吗？\r\n虽然我不知道能不能\r\n照你所说的完成就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea501110f376c5ba6963fb5c5f8eaad4f4d77406f5d2a804e75957845b32094f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79f81717a391236fdceb4681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸，可以去跑一跑了吗？\r\n我已经快要克制不住自己了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "628d6235cf612cc77c91f776ec7239a98da70fe77c55e7c952efe1b0d2f1f231",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a89338d2c597a076dfb6ac03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～～清新的空气\r\n充满了身体各个角落……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe2fc0e23c70405be83b6ea8b74dd26527c37f20f8d08fd78302c73cdeb79ff7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a752e38f603773196ea8b36f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛道上有许多凹凸不平之处。\r\n我想它至今为止\r\n一定承受过各种跑法吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "363f3de924cd7aecf05f800ff671129a127e383f3385704c034a63ac586e21dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:413e89b1d6d00b73ae3a7ee1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像我有属于自己的跑法一样，\r\n我也想看看那些\r\n只有你才能做到的事情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4d023f725f407e9b5a87ba927596cca96c4667871c7dbd84d6f0c826fb907b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c50b46f2d6715d1392e5b049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我去描绘我的梦想，\r\n而你也看着属于你的梦想，\r\n这样最适合我们了……对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3c2198c3a5f121d3fff4ef15890ad49c58b7845feb84619adf0a8bcf69aec50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96a2138c3f947e9dc29cff5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里可真是辽阔呢。\r\n感觉能够做比平常更多的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "758112d165e8e553c6d33ce9211841c589d879b66a227e7a21ee5b1be3717603",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b21040622b2fabfc4d126156",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很庆幸我的伙伴是你……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1acd33d3a5f55c7f65e0ac6d55c54907f24e115dbbfdd5215ec0e0a1cbb9cf71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35677093edaa4e646f1643aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为有你，我才能自由奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37a44f38a929cc3c2e5e22ff3d65539ee7cf2455274125dcfcfe026d1853b2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:271f82ef2ae39b3fa6b0e33f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉非常畅快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d54863152a5c1c38bf39d3fa77f6c836701d9e8a664c5e133ffd6ca6cb8f6418",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e1ac16efa767deeaedd6204",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎能更加展翅高飞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4f19f8c3cca3a44eda73059b9d5cd4b1981e0a05be592c1bc719eb1a9bd53c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:813cc9486fc15f5ce7f5d0f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，我是千明代表。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b82fc356aac3ed21f7e530e04ba835e4076b38a24d19a4f086a7b9ca54facf95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13931c914d4a947ad0a9873b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有规则和禁忌的束缚，\r\n我的道路由我自己决定！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ad7e5bb603d0fc5b034ee3b20c8d19d339115bf8d0c51951981484e42f6925b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64c520b5fbd447a1ef01e56f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有我可以帮忙的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffd1ebb77540ae3214b7e2ff9e4962cfb8a41099f044b99a73d5dc1aa8e4fd40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:230bdc1923e137eca86e994c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感到无所不能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16ea6db429bba4dc39298de8873f26ad8d8b28ed497fb0c7c6762b6aecee8240",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfba1707225e8cbdeb606c59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "麻烦你了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5821ab28e7b7a9ae9e0fa604b63c55093c3571f60d31b0cabffb55455ee25937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81ee87494c4bc9859d90eeb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来我也有优点……\r\n训练员的话，\r\n真的给了我很大的鼓励……",
      "source_fingerprint": "23fbd878ea695f05c394da47b1663bf8f0772cd67f677a0f081e235e334c86e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cbffe101e9dead0e4dd5e8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "い、行ってきます…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31da5591be773abe0b77a2dc99bb251a9eb42a39df67a1b89d89823584cbde26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef79acbf8c3b8310287271d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "た、ただいま戻りました…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2024eb0577a1dd3a52be94afd730f8a4ad64dc3172f79e9cce29ed439ec06e15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c55a8ac6292d59ca842ccb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和训练员在一起时的我……\r\n就会稍微有点信心……\r\n就会稍微有点，喜欢的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfb7f69c68847cdec27df99c54dba31e0e9c23f87f13a246e88f6634566ac38d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:596adaddd500c928ed5f26d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是这么一个容易出状况的人，\r\n你也还是接纳了我、相信我……\r\n谢、谢谢你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "055b172b88e89c2e1c76c9a2013a006d2944b39d0b8b6938fcfe0cea62cd5301",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb6318a4a715a06e6cc5341e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "板羽球真的好困难……\r\n我每次挥的时机都慢半拍，\r\n没多久就满脸墨汁了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "686ef6bcd92065e814e03611ed3910ff152b376f9f0e0d69bd0cdcc9bd4a35fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35fdc8b33290c1869275960c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我自己做了巧克力……\r\n但帮我试吃的神宫却晕倒了……\r\n我该怎么办才好～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a0ffdd4d8cec1817928225421737b283ecf1c8aee345460403600b6f6ec7fff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e405081807c533811e2ebb0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请、请问……你想吃巧克力吗？\r\n虽然我……很不会做菜，\r\n但还是勉强完成了一个……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f40db7c0b851a2e67269b9df7e6ac88b26a4ef62cfc1a96d100b563a26d96609",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24ea0e7b0f32331771a9a81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在签纸上写好了愿望～\r\n……虽然忘记写上自己的名字，\r\n但还是会实现的……对吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "06fa34df8de2ec0e5001be8dbd0ea8ffe9f4b9a626ed7cf9683000d01951228a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a2f706bcfcaf2448ba06331",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦？今天是万圣节！？\r\n我问一下……训练员你……\r\n应该……不会恶作剧吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "884f2519ca6a2ff2248a8d4f1021e10fc08cab8f49040539e4edee491a15ba0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:152f0cb0365921b4367ed34b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说圣诞老人当中，\r\n也有像我这样的冒失鬼……\r\n……好想要认识一下哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdaa016e448b4a6fdbc3319f032d50b8d1db561fbf7e10e253c7b4e3ee3979f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daaac8d7c1bca28ddb62b463",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要送给训练员的礼物……\r\n我没有忘记带出来哦！\r\n晚点你愿意收下吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "293e857ff3b95be1ec4b138efe6b07e34624fd1220f0677d11ce2838663b721b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8438e654e173336f5bb84d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这并不是在做梦吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e91b6d414e47271dfe8f7f9bc214b117e3e5a3fb914a393516e06f3ac8edf18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b72caf24a5b5a421f1668b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大扫除的时候，\r\n我总是会越整理越乱呢……\r\n每次都只能交给神宫去做……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9a37302bbd2fa76e0db9113414ee717d6e47546e0961550b82edc28c86b69ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff2a7ab1854e38afc01ff33d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐～\r\n为了让你能有安稳的一天，\r\n我会乖乖躲在角落里的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "de75baf59849528b82300682da6762b3e5a1431cfb8760924ad9e8e49b9977e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96cfb8948a7ac1d6dcdef0c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得的生日你还愿意跟我在一起……\r\n真的很谢谢你。\r\n我、我会认真帮你庆生的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "798b7cc04c775d4b2c335e14f1cfc0ccb711ec8da10d63fa0c06409da888a68d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81c99f47d6d62808e0b4685b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日是这样的我也能变主角的日子，\r\n也是能获得很多祝福的……\r\n幸福的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "782b331a5778ea899b7b6aab12e43004962a4b0eb799dc419e5ab35f7aeed7b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec128d6eaa7737bd9890e66d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要、要送给我的礼物？呜呜……\r\n你记得我的生日，\r\n就已经是最棒的礼物了说～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d074bd8e96249e3136f92d2787548e1674b09e4506c3040b2754d3ca9e060b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7975b7fd84404c59a1b2e6e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有新的公告呢～\r\n……我很容易就忘记去看内容，\r\n所以一定要好好确认才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "312ca24a1cfd47de736fd5c441ae7a4eb5e4bfcd2eb037557da7d581e5decee3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12c5b4032c2b64aca0e4d273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物咯～\r\n好像都没有跟我一样\r\n忘记写送件人名字的耶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a40ff5d7604e28317bac28ad9310c6dee826fc3aa6af4ac41ded41167b2e4af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d7d1e999e4f705eb9ee7f99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成，恭喜你～\r\n训练员果然很厉害呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c0789b6a53f13278f632b3d2023cee749eff8f6b8c20d8a490335128756887",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:199308de3cf3b736d31708db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就、就快要有活动了呢……\r\n希望当天可以不要给人惹麻烦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "67078b3b20fe3abc57840c235cf298a6b3064bc9d50fbc9756b44c177b1a9af3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98b3a886e44257b43f140a28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像正在举办活动哦～\r\n只是稍微偷看一下的话，\r\n应该不会妨碍到别人吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "774396ad3335b18dd5cfa6e92b4a85dbe4bda9aa55d4d796ac4252e1d0523063",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c795cfcd4e290fe5c6332b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎……怎么这样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "65cc07e22efb559722ada244ebed8a3a518467a09030290605acb892f6659839",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b937b3347e948c729b7de5c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃……\r\n赛马娘名鉴的等级好像提升了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f4d98490f4a5a333971c6991c29de62688936d95ea11d43711b3f50ec1ea3d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ad83021408b324e3ec47c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勇気を出して花柄を選んで\r\nみたんですが、派手過ぎましたかね\r\nはぅ、ごめんなさいぃ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f304e353f104aa201ed6e82550b6453c7127d0b983b9f19ca549f7479c21d01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b44d15738d304ec9f98bc14e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このスカート、前に猫ちゃんが\r\n載ってくれて…また来てくれたら\r\nいいですねぇ～…えへへ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0f84c3577bb8260a72cb08267d903fde8a6722ab78cb1c2bafcd22d4c55f78d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25d2ec70c42c971da6dc06b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "動物園のヤギさんに、お花の柄の\r\nところをかじられたことがあって…\r\n本物じゃなくてごめんなさいぃ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff93d1e4c853d5acc7ae0389d629af30c9e3763bf8fc17e0b1bafbd8d652ff5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a56f8f3f89807eacf7ce22e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感情很好……的感觉？",
      "source_fingerprint": "29cf32f3551555eeab1ac1430478c8db2c1077bcb5739b051b6b9373766e9658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:583d6a1d9d33fb5f6c5625d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这都是大家的功劳……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6222d050993c39a888e5e7efdcea3ec1a529ec12382edae06a03d4d92ae806c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d1e9faa8781b0332a3e0de7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎……怎么这样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "65cc07e22efb559722ada244ebed8a3a518467a09030290605acb892f6659839",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6acc7e8fd76347856d528a5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感情很好……的感觉？",
      "source_fingerprint": "29cf32f3551555eeab1ac1430478c8db2c1077bcb5739b051b6b9373766e9658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9df8f8768c44f3e5855eb9ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "创、创下高分纪录了～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4bf46abf0480f487141a26c20016bc380c572bc2f0d263e13a1371952df1cd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:854c861c2e1e82d3e5180221",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就……一起好好努力吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2411038b902f726d032587ad67242e1159e0e670774de5b2b7aa8d6e3c276bae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ca3bb4a8651cf9251dae10d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我深感惶恐……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a18fbd36570de1321deb7cea21dc265baf355527cfc7bf29c8f8531cabd2c417",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48a72fa3e9d05138a01fa3da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "027b814497c414b0dbfbb1d98428e2115f22c192e11011830b2a6d6720770894",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8d2736c2e56e5c4d13df32e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素滴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e55caf64ba23ef1c5d2d00319072a3cd0f9775f6ba7b10e310ae634b18a54a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21cfbf18b8f98b62bda5235d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
